# Keep host artefacts and secrets out of the build context. Dependencies are installed inside the
# image with `npm ci`; host node_modules (often built for another OS) must never be copied in.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/dist-preview
**/coverage
**/uploads
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*.log
**/test-results
.git
.vscode
.idea
docs/screenshots
e2e/screenshots
